aragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  ではでは\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  "}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-24875":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは！\n \n けやき坂46の加藤史帆です！\n \n 今回のブログは21日の加藤を紹介します〜(^｡^)！\n \n 2部\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ1EY1TYZDJXBNWDFT25S96","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ1EZ3ZMV7A9DXYS0J7DJ1H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n カメラに向かってくる加藤\n お気に入りのNADIAのワンピース！袖がスケスケなの🤭\n まだちょっと寒かった🤧(笑)\n \n 3部\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ1F04N512G0JA0HX8NRZ63","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n 三つ編み〜！！\n 三つ編み好きって言ってくださる方意外と多くて嬉しかった💓\n \n 4部\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ1F184T4DGXM6YW3T4CE6F","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ1F29XQXWZ314QS6JKTYRG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n 近いっ🤭\n \n MOUSSYのワンピースに、髪型はハーフアップのお団子？にしました！\n 1番皆さんが褒めてくれて、嬉しかったです(^｡^)\n \n 5部\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ1F3AJ3EAS9A0WT7N7A384","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ1F4NBPGD9KZN12583SAAK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n 最後はツインテールにしたよ！\n ゆるふわ〜！！\n \n \n \n \n 1部ずつ写真付きで紹介しましたがどうでしたかー？\n あ、皆さんが好きな服装とか髪型しりたいなあ（´-`）.｡oO\n \n 良かったらレターとか握手会で教えてくださいね😮\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ1F5PPGV6XP52NVZ24MW0P","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n 加藤史帆"}],"source":"archive"}}